    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "SurroundingArea",
      "text": "With a stay at W6 Hotel Hammersmith in London (Hammersmith and Fulham), you\u0027ll be within a 5-minute drive of Kensington High Street and Westfield London Shopping Centre.  This aparthotel is 0.5 mi (0.8 km) from Thames River and 2.5 mi (4.1 km) from Natural History Museum."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "RoomTypes",
      "text": "Make yourself at home in one of the 29 individually decorated guestrooms, featuring kitchenettes with refrigerators and microwaves. Flat-screen televisions and DVD players are provided for your entertainment, while complimentary wireless internet access keeps you connected. Conveniences include safes and electric kettles, and housekeeping is provided daily."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PropertyInformation",
      "text": "Take in the views from a garden and make use of amenities such as complimentary wireless internet access and concierge services."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "AreaActivities",
      "text": "Distances are displayed to the nearest 0.1 mile and kilometer. \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003Cp\u003EEventim Apollo - 0.6 km / 0.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Thames River - 0.8 km / 0.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Olympia Conference and Exhibition Centre - 1.5 km / 0.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Kensington High Street - 1.6 km / 1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Westfield London Shopping Centre - 2.1 km / 1.3 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Cromwell Road - 2.4 km / 1.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Kensington Gardens - 3.4 km / 2.1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Portobello Road Market - 3.6 km / 2.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Kensington Palace - 3.8 km / 2.3 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Stamford Bridge Stadium - 3.8 km / 2.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Imperial College London - 3.9 km / 2.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Royal Albert Hall - 4.1 km / 2.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Queensway - 4.1 km / 2.6 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Hyde Park - 4.2 km / 2.6 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Natural History Museum - 4.3 km / 2.6 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe nearest airports are:\u003Cbr /\u003EHeathrow Airport (LHR) - 20.4 km / 12.7 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E London City Airport (LCY) - 22 km / 13.6 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Gatwick Airport (LGW) - 88.2 km / 54.8 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Luton Airport (LTN) - 57.3 km / 35.6 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Stansted Airport (STN) - 76.5 km / 47.5 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PoliciesDisclaimers",
      "text": "\u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003EExtra-person charges may apply and vary depending on property policy\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGovernment-issued photo identification and a credit card, debit card, or cash deposit may be required at check-in for incidental charges\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESpecial requests are subject to availability upon check-in and may incur additional charges; special requests cannot be guaranteed\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis property accepts credit cards; cash is not accepted\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHost has not indicated whether there is a carbon monoxide detector on the property; consider bringing a portable detector with you on the trip\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHost has indicated there is a smoke detector on the property\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESafety features at this property include a fire extinguisher, a security system, a first aid kit, and window guards\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPlease note that cultural norms and guest policies may differ by country and by property; the policies listed are provided by the property\u003C/li\u003E  \u003C/ul\u003E \u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003EAll guests must show a valid photo identification at check-in. This is the only form of identification that is accepted at this property.\u003C/li\u003E  \u003C/ul\u003E \u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003EThis property\u0027s policy is to refuse certain bookings for the purpose of group events or parties, including pre-wedding stag/bachelor and hen/bachelorette parties. \u003C/li\u003E \u003C/ul\u003E"
